#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2219 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "STYPE record present but TSVAL='OBSERVATIONAL' -> $interventional_count=0 (TSVAL filter key fails - exact-match AND) -> condition branch false -> silent."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSPARM   type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
S1 | TS | 1 | STYPE | Study Type | OBSERVATIONAL
S1 | TS | 2 | TTYPE | Trial Type | NATURAL HISTORY
